 ry=\"12\" fill=\"url(#ru)\"/><ellipse cx=\"155\" cy=\"128\" rx=\"24\" ry=\"12\" fill=\"url(#ru)\"/><ellipse cx=\"85\" cy=\"150\" rx=\"24\" ry=\"10\" fill=\"url(#ru)\"/><ellipse cx=\"155\" cy=\"150\" rx=\"24\" ry=\"10\" fill=\"url(#ru)\"/><ellipse cx=\"120\" cy=\"180\" rx=\"16\" ry=\"11\" fill=\"url(#ru)\"/><ellipse cx=\"98\" cy=\"208\" rx=\"10\" ry=\"8\" fill=\"url(#ru)\"/><ellipse cx=\"142\" cy=\"208\" rx=\"10\" ry=\"8\" fill=\"url(#ru)\"/><ellipse cx=\"84\" cy=\"112\" rx=\"18\" ry=\"7\" fill=\"url(#ru)\"/><ellipse cx=\"156\" cy=\"112\" rx=\"18\" ry=\"7\" fill=\"url(#ru)\"/><path d=\"M66 116 Q84 106 102 114\" stroke=\"#5A3D32\" stroke-width=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M138 114 Q156 106 174 116\" stroke=\"#5A3D32\" stroke-width=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M70 138 Q85 128 100 138\" stroke=\"#3A2A24\" stroke-width=\"4\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M140 138 Q155 128 170 138\" stroke=\"#3A2A24\" stroke-width=\"4\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M118 150 Q114 176 110 182 Q120 188 130 182\" stroke=\"#C9A08C\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M98 206 Q120 198 142 206 Q120 222 98 206 Z\" fill=\"#D88A86\"/></svg><span>울먹 · 눈가·코끝·입가</span></div></div><p class=\"ds\">눈 밑만 물들이던 낮술 메이크업 다음 유행은 <b>울고 난 것처럼</b> 눈과 코 주변이 붉은 울먹 메이크업이에요.</p><div class=\"tip\"><span>POINT</span>붉은 기를 넓게 펴지 말고, 눈가·코끝·입가에 조금씩 나눠 얹어요.</div><div class=\"foot\">* 출처: 얼루어 코리아 (2026.10.02)</div>"
